    "preamble": "S. Hanumanthu vs The State Of Telangana on 16 February, 2022",
    "facts": "These four crimes are registered under Sections 323, 356, 379, 354 and 382 of Indian Penal Code. In Cr.No.111 of 200, it is alleged that the detenu snatched away gold nuptial thread from the neck of the wife of complainant. In Cr.No.128 of 2020, it was alleged that the detenu snatched away gold nuptial thread weighing two tulas infront of the house of complainant. In Cr.Nos.132 & 146 of 2020 also similar allegations were made.",
